<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Student Dashboard</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/dashboard.css">
</head>

<body>
    <main>
        <h1>Student Management Dashboard</h1>
        <p>Manage student records from one centralized dashboard. Add new students, organize class-wise information,
            update existing records, monitor attendance, and view complete student profiles with ease.</p>

        <div class="student-add">
            <h2>Add New Student / New Registration</h2>
            <p>Register a new student by entering all required information including personal details, class, section,
                contact information, and admission details. The student will automatically appear in the appropriate
                class list after being added.</p>
            <button><a style="color: white; text-decoration: none;" , href="dashboard/add"> Add New Student
                    🆕</a></button>
        </div>

        <div class="student-list">
            <h2>Show All Students by Class</h2>
            <p>Browse students organized according to their respective classes. Select any class to view its students,
                update their information, or remove records whenever necessary.</p>
            <div class="class-grid">
                <button><a href="/dashboard/class/class 1" style="text-decoration: none;  ">📘 Class 1</a></button>
                <button><a href="/dashboard/class/class 2" style="text-decoration: none; ">📗 Class 2</a></button>
                <button><a href="/dashboard/class/class 3" style="text-decoration: none;">📙 Class 3</a></button>
                <button><a href="/dashboard/class/class 4" style="text-decoration: none; ">📕 Class 4</a></button>
                <button><a href="/dashboard/class/class 5" style="text-decoration: none; ">📓 Class 5</a></button>
                <button><a href="/dashboard/class/class 6" style="text-decoration: none; ">📒 Class 6</a></button>
                <button><a href="/dashboard/class/class 7" style="text-decoration: none; ">📔 Class 7</a></button>
                <button><a href="/dashboard/class/class 8" style="text-decoration: none; ">📚 Class 8</a></button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="student-info">
            <form action="/dashboard/student-info" method="post">
                <h2>Student Profile & Academic Details</h2>
                <p>View complete information about every registered student, including personal details, academic
                    information, attendance records, contact details, and admission information in one organized
                    profile.
                </p>
                <div class="form">
                    <div>
                        <label for="">First Name</label>
                        <input type="text" name="firstname" required placeholder="Enter First Name" id="">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label for="">Last Name</label>
                        <input type="text" name="lastname" required placeholder="Enter Last Name" id="">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label for="">Roll Number</label>
                        <input type="text" name="rollno" placeholder="Enter Roll Number" required id="">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label for="">Class</label>
                        <select name="chooseclass" required id="">
                            <option value="">--Select--</option>
                            <option value="class 1">Class 1</option>
                            <option value="class 2">Class 2</option>
                            <option value="class 3">Class 3</option>
                            <option value="class 4">Class 4</option>
                            <option value="class 5">Class 5</option>
                            <option value="class 6">Class 6</option>
                            <option value="class 7">Class 7</option>
                            <option value="class 8">Class 8</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <button type="submit">Student Details →</button>
                    </div>

            </form>
        </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="home-btn">← Back to Home</a>

    </main>
</body>

</html>